    "On your 500 kcal days, focus entirely on lean protein and leafy greens to stay full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "В разгрузочные дни (500 ккал) делайте упор на постный белок и зелень для сытости."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setze an 500-kcal-Tagen auf mageres Protein und grünes Gemüse."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En días de 500 kcal, prioriza proteína magra y hojas verdes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jours à 500 kcal, privilégiez protéines maigres et légumes verts."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nei giorni da 500 kcal punta su proteine magre e verdure verdi."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nos dias de 500 kcal foque-se em proteína magra e folhas verdes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Meal A Day. Extreme fat burn and repair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Один приём пищи в день. Глубокое жиросжигание и восстановление."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Mahlzeit am Tag. Starke Fettverbrennung & Zellreparatur."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una comida al día. Máxima quema y reparación."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un repas par jour. Combustion intense et régénération."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un pasto al giorno. Massima combustione e riparazione."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma refeição por dia. Queima intensa e reparação."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One day on, one day off. Breaks plateaus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "День через день. Помогает пробить плато."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abwechselnde Tage. Durchbricht Gewichtsplateaus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un día sí, un día no. Rompe estancamientos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un jour sur deux. Brise les plateaux."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un giorno sì e uno no. Supera gli stalli."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dia sim, dia não. Quebra estagnações."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One treat doesn't undo your progress. Drink a glass of water, enjoy a protein-forward next meal, and skip any guilt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Одно удовольствие не отменяет прогресс. Выпейте стакан воды, сделайте следующий приём пищи с хорошим белком и без чувства вины."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Genuss macht nichts kaputt. Trinke Wasser, iss beim nächsten Mal eiweißreich – ganz ohne Reue."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un capricho no arruina tu progreso. Bebe agua y disfruta tu próxima comida con proteína sin culpa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plaisir n'efface pas vos progrès. Buvez de l'eau et reprenez un repas protéiné sans culpabilité."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uno strappo non rovina i progressi. Bevi acqua e goditi il prossimo pasto proteico senza sensi di colpa."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um mimo não apaga o progresso. Beba água e faça a próxima refeição proteica sem culpa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the downsampled photo you capture or pick for meal, menu, cooking-step, or progress analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the downsampled photo you capture or pick for meal, menu, cooking-step, or progress analysis."
