    "When enabled, downsampled meal, menu, cooking-step, and progress photos you choose to analyze are sent over encrypted HTTPS via FoodTracker's proxy to OpenRouter and third-party AI vision providers. Photos are processed transiently with provider data retention disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, downsampled meal, menu, cooking-step, and progress photos you choose to analyze are sent over encrypted HTTPS via FoodTracker's proxy to OpenRouter and third-party AI vision providers. Photos are processed transiently with provider data retention disabled."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Когда включено, уменьшенные фото блюд, меню, этапов готовки и прогресса, которые вы выбираете для анализа, отправляются по зашифрованному HTTPS через прокси FoodTracker в OpenRouter и сторонним ИИ-провайдерам без сохранения данных."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert, werden verkleinerte Mahlzeiten-, Menü-, Kochschritt- und Fortschrittsfotos, die Sie analysieren möchten, per HTTPS über den FoodTracker-Proxy ohne Datenspeicherung an OpenRouter und KI-Drittanbieter gesendet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si está activado, las fotos reducidas de comidas, menús, pasos de cocina y progreso que decidas analizar se envían por HTTPS cifrado mediante el proxy de FoodTracker a OpenRouter y proveedores externos de IA sin retención de datos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si activé, les photos réduites de repas, menus, étapes de cuisson et progression que vous choisissez d’analyser sont envoyées via HTTPS chiffré par le proxy FoodTracker à OpenRouter et des fournisseurs IA tiers sans conservation des données."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se attivo, le foto ridotte di pasti, menu, passaggi di cucina e progressi che scegli di analizzare vengono inviate via HTTPS crittografato tramite il proxy di FoodTracker a OpenRouter e fornitori IA di terze parti senza conservazione dei dati."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando ativado, as fotos reduzidas de refeições, menus, passos de receita e progresso que escolher analisar são enviadas por HTTPS encriptado através do proxy do FoodTracker para o OpenRouter e fornecedores IA de terceiros sem retenção de dados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
